  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/3c877032-ae6f-4da0-bb94-64e2f188d04f.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:3.54167in;height:1.16667in\" /><br />Bond order of <math><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>]</mo></math> in <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1.0</mn></math><br />Bond order of <math><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>]</mo></math> in <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2.0</mn></math><br />So sum of bond order between same bonded atoms in Q and R compounds = 1 + 2.0 = 3.0.",
